      </ul>

      <br><!-- 添加一个空行 -->
      <h3 style="color: inherit; font-weight: bold;">😊 Miscellaneous</h3>
      <p>I love music 🎵, sports (basketball 🏀, football ⚽, running 🏃‍♂️, etc.), traveling the world 🗺️, hanging out with friends 🍻, and trying anything new. Click on Totoro below ↘️ to hear one of my favorite songs: 失恋ソング沢山聴いて泣いてばかりの私はもう。</p>

      <br><!-- 添加一个空行 -->
      <!-- 访客地球仪:Umami 采集 + globe.gl 渲染,滚动到才加载 -->
    <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center align-items-center">
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 mt-3 mt-md-0 text-center visitor-globe-wrap">
            <div
                id="visitor-globe"
                data-visitors="{{ '/assets/json/visitors.json' | relative_url }}"
                data-world="{{ '/assets/json/countries-110m.json' | relative_url }}"
                style="max-width: 260px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; margin: 0 auto;"
            ></div>
            <div id="visitor-globe-caption" class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 4px;"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4 mt-3 mt-md-0 text-center">
            <img
                id="totoro-audio-player"
                src="{{ '/assets/img/totorobottle.gif' | relative_url }}"
                alt="Totoro Bottle"
                style="cursor: pointer; max-width: 150px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto;"
                title="Click to play harp music"
            />
            <audio id="harp-audio" src="{{ '/assets/audio/harp.mp3' | relative_url }}" preload="auto"></audio>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const totoroImage = document.getElementById('totoro-audio-player');
            const harpAudio = document.getElementById('harp-audio');

            if (totoroImage && harpAudio) { // Ensure elements exist before adding listeners
                totoroImage.addEventListener('click', function() {
                    if (harpAudio.paused) {
                        harpAudio.play()
                            .catch(e => console.error("Error playing audio:", e));
                    } else {
                        harpAudio.pause();
                        harpAudio.currentTime = 0; // Reset playback to the beginning
                    }
                });
            } else {
                console.warn("Totoro image or harp audio element not found. Audio playback may not work.");
            }
        });
    </script>

    <script defer src="{{ '/assets/js/visitor-globe.js' | relative_url }}"></script>

    <!-- Social -->
    {% if page.social %}
      <div class="social">
        <div class="contact-icons">{% include social.liquid %}</div>

        <div class="contact-note">{{ site.contact_note }}</div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if site.newsletter and site.newsletter.enabled and site.footer_fixed %}
      {% include newsletter.liquid center=true %}
    {% endif %}
  </article>
</div>
